    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dustino 64, go from nobody to a hero as Dustin, a regular guy on a journey through a charming indie platformer inspired by Super Mario 64, on a quest to collect enough Gems to save Queen Merigold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have a range of abilities, from punching, triple jumping, wall-jumping and sliding, to navigate the world and overcome whatever you find. Along the journey, encounter unique enemies, puzzles and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sandbox 3D Platformer gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intends to capture what the classic 3D platformers did right, which is their sandbox levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the entire game with a friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hub Worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connected hubs similar to what was done in Sonic Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Inspired Game Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of 3D platformers such as Mario 64 and Banjo Kazooie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lighting Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N64 like Lighting, Toggle for real shadows, also a Day-Night Cycle</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dustino 64, go from nobody to a hero as Dustin, a regular guy on a journey through a charming indie platformer inspired by Super Mario 64, on a quest to collect enough Gems to save Queen Merigold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have a range of abilities, from punching, triple jumping, wall-jumping and sliding, to navigate the world and overcome whatever you find. Along the journey, encounter unique enemies, puzzles and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sandbox 3D Platformer gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intends to capture what the classic 3D platformers did right, which is their sandbox levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the entire game with a friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hub Worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connected hubs similar to what was done in Sonic Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Inspired Game Design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of 3D platformers such as Mario 64 and Banjo Kazooie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lighting Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N64 like Lighting, Toggle for real shadows, also a Day-Night Cycle</p>",
    "short_description": "An indie 3D platformer inspired by Super Mario 64, go from nobody to a hero as Dustin, through vibrant hub worlds and stages to collect enough Gems to save Queen Merigold.",
